      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Quarterly Review: Why the Tide Keeps Ghosting Us",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-1826d8f2",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "marks": [
            {
              "attrs": {},
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "Reporting Period:",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": " Q2 (The Quarter of Wet Abandonment)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "data-block-id": "block-1348db9a"
      },
      "type": "horizontalRule"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-995040f8",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Executive Summary",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-31aef01c",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The tide came in. The tide went out. It did not text back.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-ecc3aa14",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "This pattern has persisted for approximately 4.5 billion years, yet management remains surprised.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-a06fce50",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Case Studies",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-be93acef",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The Beach at Midnight",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-b34ba5ed",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Left standing. Wet footprints. Silence.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-daaad78f",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Analysis: The tide expressed interest (foamy approach), established proximity (wet sand), then withdrew without explanation (receding water). Classic ghosting behavior.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-2148511e",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The Sandcastle Incident",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-d518850c",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "A structure was built. Promises were made (\"I'll hold the moat,\" said the tide). Then: nothing.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-9a979973",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The moat remains empty. The castle stands alone.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-8e802d6d",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Root Causes",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-9bc3f4fa",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "ordered"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-a62188e0",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "attrs": {},
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Lunar Influence:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " The Moon (see separate HR complaint) keeps pulling the tide away from us",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-e5c0d733",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "ordered"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-9e3c22cd",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "attrs": {},
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Commitment Issues:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " The tide appears to have a rotation with multiple shorelines",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-15dbbe1d",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "ordered"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-36cd7614",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "marks": [
                {
                  "attrs": {},
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Fundamental Physics:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": " Gravity doesn't care about our feelings",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-a6290820",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Recommendations",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-07e14317",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "We must accept that:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-df246730",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "bullet"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-69a6ce0e",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The tide's absence is not about us",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-9e739612",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "bullet"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-7809e934",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Its return is not a sign of changed feelings",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-d0ce0dc9",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "bullet"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-4fd390b6",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Water does not engage in attachment",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "checked": false,
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-93b28b29",
        "indent": 0,
        "listType": "bullet"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "attrs": {
            "collapsed": false,
            "data-block-id": "block-0c9f40bc",
            "indent": 0
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "We are anthropomorphizing a planetary hydrological cycle",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "type": "listItem"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-90850863",
        "indent": 0,
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "Outlook",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-32b63fe4",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "The tide will return.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-cd3320ee",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "It will also leave again.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-0b6594b6",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "This is not a relationship. This is physics.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "data-block-id": "block-b973ed87",
        "indent": 0
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "text": "We are working on our boundaries.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "attrs": {
        "data-block-id": "block-b5919b78"
      },
      "type": "horizontalRule"
    },
    {
